1814 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Once you have identified accumulation, avoid entering a trade immediately. The Manipulation Phase is designed to trap retail traders by creating a false breakout. During this phase, price will often spike sharply above resistance or drop below support, triggering stop-losses and inducing traders into the wrong direction. It is crucial to recognize this as a liquidity grab rather than a real breakout. A key sign of manipulation is when price quickly reverses after breaking a key level, forming a long wick or an engulfing candle. Instead of chasing the breakout, wait for confirmation that the manipulation is complete.)
/E (Once you have identified accumulation, avoid entering a trade immediately. The Manipulation Phase is designed to trap retail traders by creating a false breakout. During this phase, price will often spike sharply above resistance or drop below support, triggering stop-losses and inducing traders into the wrong direction. It is crucial to recognize this as a liquidity grab rather than a real breakout. A key sign of manipulation is when price quickly reverses after breaking a key level, forming a long wick or an engulfing candle. Instead of chasing the breakout, wait for confirmation that the manipulation is complete.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [1 2]
