/E (It  represents areas with a large number of sell orders, often clustered around support levels or previous lows. When the price moves towards these areas, stop-loss orders and pending sell orders can be triggered, creating a surge om selling pressure. This increased liquidity allow market makers and institutions to execute large buy orders efficiently without impacting price.)
