/E (After confirmation, the best entry is typically on a retracement or pullback to a supply or demand zone created during the sweep. This offers a high-probability, low-risk trade with a favorable entry. The stop-loss should be placed just beyond the extreme of the sweep \(the higher high or lower low\), and your target can be the next imbalance, fair value gap, or structural level.)
