2975 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (This entire behavior illustrates how institutions manage their risk and adjust to market conditions. The mitigation block becomes a strategic area where they close out earlier losing shorts and reopen long positions, fueling the next bullish leg. For traders, this area becomes a high-probability long entry, especially when it aligns with a Break of Structure \(BOS\), a Fair Value Gap \(FVG\), or an Order Block. Confirmation through lower time frame structure shifts or bullish candlestick patterns adds further confidence to the setup.)
/E (This entire behavior illustrates how institutions manage their risk and adjust to market conditions. The mitigation block becomes a strategic area where they close out earlier losing shorts and reopen long positions, fueling the next bullish leg. For traders, this area becomes a high-probability long entry, especially when it aligns with a Break of Structure \(BOS\), a Fair Value Gap \(FVG\), or an Order Block. Confirmation through lower time frame structure shifts or bullish candlestick patterns adds further confidence to the setup.)
/Pg 113 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
