/E (To trade a Bearish Fair Value Gap \(Sell-Side FVG\), the key is to wait patiently for price to retrace back into the imbalance zone. Once price enters the FVG, look for bearish confirmation signals such as rejection wicks, bearish candlestick patterns, or confluence with a nearby bearish order block. These signs indicate that institutional sellers may be defending the area. )
/Pg 136 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
