/T (Selling within a Bearish FVG: In a bearish market, when price retraces into a bearish FVG, Smart Money seeks to use the imbalance to initiate short positions. Again, they often look for confluence with other factors like bearish order blocks or liquidity sweeps to confirm the trade idea. The FVG acts as a premium area to sell before the next move lower. \(see below visuals\))
/E (Selling within a Bearish FVG: In a bearish market, when price retraces into a bearish FVG, Smart Money seeks to use the imbalance to initiate short positions. Again, they often look for confluence with other factors like bearish order blocks or liquidity sweeps to confirm the trade idea. The FVG acts as a premium area to sell before the next move lower. \(see below visuals\))
