3424 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (If an institution misses the initial impulsive move, they may wait for price to retrace into the newly formed FVG to secure an entry at a better price. By doing so, they align with the dominant order flow at a discount. Conversely, if institutions want to take partial profits or exit a position, they may offload some of their holdings when price returns to an FVG, especially if it aligns with higher-timeframe resistance or liquidity pools.)
/E (If an institution misses the initial impulsive move, they may wait for price to retrace into the newly formed FVG to secure an entry at a better price. By doing so, they align with the dominant order flow at a discount. Conversely, if institutions want to take partial profits or exit a position, they may offload some of their holdings when price returns to an FVG, especially if it aligns with higher-timeframe resistance or liquidity pools.)
