/T (The  area between 50% and 61.8% , also known as the "Golden Zone," is one of the most powerful areas for reversals. Price often reacts strongly from this zone because it aligns with natural market behaviors and institutional order flow. Deeper retracements, like the 71.5% and 78.6% levels, are even more precise. These areas are often targeted for "sniper entries," where the risk is minimized and the potential reward is maximized. By combining the basic premium/discount concept with Fibonacci refinement, traders can develop a much more accurate and confident approach to entering trades at the right time and place.)
