3622 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (After marking the Swing High and Swing Low, use the Fibonacci Retracement tool. If the market moved upward \(bullish move\), draw the tool from the Swing Low up to the Swing High. If the market moved downward \(bearish move\), draw it from the Swing High down to the Swing Low. This will plot important retracement levels on your chart, including 38.2%, 50%, 61.8%, 71.5%, and 78.6%. These levels highlight where the price might pull back to before continuing its original direction.)
/E (After marking the Swing High and Swing Low, use the Fibonacci Retracement tool. If the market moved upward \(bullish move\), draw the tool from the Swing Low up to the Swing High. If the market moved downward \(bearish move\), draw it from the Swing High down to the Swing Low. This will plot important retracement levels on your chart, including 38.2%, 50%, 61.8%, 71.5%, and 78.6%. These levels highlight where the price might pull back to before continuing its original direction.)
/Pg 159 0 R
/K [7 8]
