/T (Step 4: Once you see confirmation, place your trade. In a bullish setup, enter a buy position within the OTE zone. In a bearish setup, enter a sell position within the OTE zone. Your stop-loss should be placed safely just beyond the 78.6% level \(or just below/above the Swing Low/High\), giving the market some breathing room while still protecting your capital. Your take-profit can be set at the previous Swing High \(for buys\) or Swing Low \(for sells\), or at a key liquidity area further out, depending on your risk-to-reward goals.)
