/T (On the other hand, a Change of Character \(ChoCH\) signals that the trend might be reversing. If price has been going up and suddenly breaks below a previous higher low, it may be the start of a downtrend. Similarly, if a market in a downtrend breaks above a previous lower high, it could be shifting into an uptrend. This is your early warning sign that something has changed and the market could be turning.)
/E (On the other hand, a Change of Character \(ChoCH\) signals that the trend might be reversing. If price has been going up and suddenly breaks below a previous higher low, it may be the start of a downtrend. Similarly, if a market in a downtrend breaks above a previous lower high, it could be shifting into an uptrend. This is your early warning sign that something has changed and the market could be turning.)
