/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Imagine price is approaching a bullish order block located in a discount zone, between the 61.8% and 78.6% Fibonacci retracement levels. A trader using the conservative approach will wait for price to enter the order block and watch how it reacts. Once a strong bullish engulfing candle forms within this zone, the trader enters a long position, confident that smart money is stepping in.)
/Pg 177 0 R
/K [6]
>>
