/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (For your take-profit levels, look to target the next structural high or the next visible liquidity pool on the higher timeframe. These are areas where price is likely to be drawn. In terms of risk management, place your stop-loss just below the low that was swept during the liquidity grab. Alternatively, for an even more conservative approach, place the stop below the OB or iFVG zone. This provides logical protection while keeping your trade aligned with the trend.)
